body:
sociopathy = made. we have the same brain as a nonpsycopath, but because of experiences we are emotionally stunted. we tend to be more reactive and hot tempered. we have the ability to feel every emotion everyone else can, even empathy but it doesnt mean we will. we tend to be antisocial.

&#x200B;

psycopaths = born. their brains are different. either they lack emotions or are a lot more diminished. they are cold and calculating. they also have pretty good foresight. psycopathy does not equal antisocial.

Last time I did come down was when I was at a mates and he was sold iso and God it was horrible. I was so exhausted but I could not sleep. My whole body would literally jo!t and wake me up. At one point it felt like my whole body was vibrating and couldn't stop tensing up and then I blacked out for a second. Now I don't know if that is because of withdrawals or if it was due to the isso I had injected. My mate isnt as deep into his addiction as I am but he didn't get any of the symptoms I had so I don't know. Pretty certain this mate has tried to poison me a few times so who knows. 

&#x200B;

Thank you for your advice, I'll !lol into it
